  "tandemSoGehts": [
    "Cut the cards in the middle. Partner A takes the left half, Partner B the right half.",
    "A builds question 1 from the tiles and reads it out: “Dove mette Lucia la bottiglia?”",
    "B only has tiles: the verb in its base form and the parts of the sentence. Build the answer and put the verb in the right form (mette, è, sono). Watch the point: a tile like “su / in” gives you two prepositions, choose the right one and fuse it with the article: su + il tavolo = sul tavolo, in + il frigo = nel frigo. A tile like “a / da” works the same way: a + la farmacia = alla farmacia.",
    "Then B asks question 2 and A answers. Take turns. At the end, check with the answer sheet.",
    "Now swap cards and do it all again, faster."
  ],
